  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekunderingen &#xe4;r knuten till V&#xe4;rldsbankens sk Nordic Trust Fund som syftar till att bygga WB&apos;s kapacitet om m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter i f&#xf6;rsta hand inom banken men ocks&#xe5; genom ett antal pilotprojekt i utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The secondment is linked to the World Bank Nordic Trust Fund, which has as its purpose to build up the WB&apos;s internal capacity and knowledge in relation to human rights. A number of small pilot projcts shall be carried out in developing countries.</narrative>
